{"id":"C5aa85fcafe02b68a359a","zh":"面耦合","en":"surface coupling","domain":"铁路动力学、信号与建模方法","definition_zh":"通过面弹簧和阻尼作用在界面范围积分，形成子结构耦合矩阵的方法。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":"原文适用板—板、板—实体及实体—实体界面；与只在离散位置建立的点耦合区分。","scope_note":null,"usage_overview":"用于在界面范围内建立结构层间连接，通过对相对变形产生的弹性与阻尼作用积分形成耦合矩阵。所述建模方法覆盖板—板、板—实体及实体—实体界面，与仅在离散位置建立连接的点耦合相区别。","translation_note":"本词条含依据文献语境拟定的参考译名。","usage_variants":[{"id":"C5aa85fcafe02b68a359a","zh":"面耦合","en":"surface coupling","domain":"铁路动力学、信号与建模方法","group_id":"He226ff41f81e34947f43","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"铁路动力学、信号与建模方法 · 徐磊（2023）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D8db154c450c54b0f4ad2","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"面耦合"},{"id":"D623d5fe81a7bb667f370","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"surface coupling"}],"sources":{"P140":{"id":"P140","title":"铁路列车-轨道-基础结构动力相互作用统一分析Part I:动力学模型构造与求解","authors":"徐磊","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20220719","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-unified-analysis-model-for-railway-train-track-substructure-dynamic-interaction-part-i-the-dynamics"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S81b9c4afff2673124207","source_id":"P140","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"en","text":"The point and surface coupling of the multi-scale finite elements between the track and the substructural layers were realized.","citations":[{"source_id":"P140","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"Sc75023d1373c79f4ef41","source_id":"P140","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"轨道-基础结构系统的子结构间除共节点耦合外,主要采用弹簧-阻尼单元实现层间结构耦合, 将子结构之间的耦合分为点耦合和面耦合。","citations":[{"source_id":"P140","page":5,"page_end":5}]},{"id":"S2c1259b3cd245ddb28c7","source_id":"P140","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"该模型引入轮轨空间动态耦合方法描述轮轨系统横向饱和蠕滑作用,垂向弹性接触采用Hertz非线性接触理论,且将车轮和钢轨均作弹性梁处理,实现轮轨柔性系统非线性时变耦合;轨道及基础结构采用不同有限单元类型模拟和组装,直接通过单元节点坐标控制单元位置并推算尺寸,实现轨道-基础结构层间多尺度单元的点、面耦合;引入循环计算方法,解决列车在长距离轨道-基础结构上的时变动力学计算问题;为了实现列车-轨道-基础结构系统的高效振动分析,将整体系统分为上部列车-轨道系统和下部基础结构系统,采用多步长-混合积分模式高效求解。","citations":[{"source_id":"P140","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"Caa072db2b4dcf56960b2","target_concept_id":"Caa072db2b4dcf56960b2","target_zh":"循环计算方法","target_en":"cyclic calculation method","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C15fa8b9ce6cedb04f243","target_concept_id":"C15fa8b9ce6cedb04f243","target_zh":"列车-轨道-基础结构","target_en":"Train-track-substructure","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cfb9028eaecb91cd62d7f","target_concept_id":"Cfb9028eaecb91cd62d7f","target_zh":"基础结构","target_en":"railway infrastructure","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C1a9ab27c87b867a7f7b8","target_concept_id":"C1a9ab27c87b867a7f7b8","target_zh":"循环计算","target_en":"cyclic calculation","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Ccfc2bc6ca41654a0742f","target_concept_id":"Ccfc2bc6ca41654a0742f","target_zh":"有限单元","target_en":"finite elements","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C5e9eebc2b141160721f8","target_concept_id":"C5e9eebc2b141160721f8","target_zh":"耦合方法","target_en":"coupling method","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P140","title":"铁路列车-轨道-基础结构动力相互作用统一分析Part I:动力学模型构造与求解","authors":"徐磊","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20220719","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-unified-analysis-model-for-railway-train-track-substructure-dynamic-interaction-part-i-the-dynamics"}]}